    {
      "Seq": 12,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 0,
      "Place": "Plain",
      "Area": "Square",
      "LocationId": 28437,
      "Actor": "Nyccolhoth Lhavyniwyn",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I find myself at noon in the village square, where my days at the stable once echoed. The well\u0027s water calls back to the days I fetched for my siblings, and the open dirt square feels like a stage, just as my world was once a daily rehearsal. I look upon the paths that lead on. Childhood memories of the stable surface, reminding me of days spent caring for animals and dreaming of fortune. I push through a storm, and the chaff blows off the threshing floor in every wind. It echoes the calm after the violent storm at the stable, where I once saved every coin.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 1,
      "Group": 3,
      "Block": 0,
      "Key": "",
      "Phrase": "",
      "Lesson": false,
      "Attempt": "",
      "Succeeded": false
    },
    {
      "Seq": 13,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 0,
      "Place": "Plain",
      "Area": "Square",
      "LocationId": 28437,
      "Actor": "Nyccolhoth Lhavyniwyn",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I spy the well at the heart of the square, its wooden bucket dangling like a grim jest. But truly, there\u0027s naught to do here. I\u0027ll seek mirth elsewhere, in a jest where laughter finds the well.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 1,
      "Group": 3,
      "Block": 1,
      "Key": "",
      "Phrase": "",
      "Lesson": false,
      "Attempt": "",
      "Succeeded": false
    },
    {
      "Seq": 14,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 0,
      "Place": "Plain",
      "Area": "Square",
      "LocationId": 28437,
      "Actor": "Nyccolhoth Lhavyniwyn",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I spy the well, stone-rimmed and solemn, but its depths hold no gold. Let\u0027s turn our gaze to the sky, where a crow perches and laughs at the world\u0027s folly.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 1,
      "Group": 3,
      "Block": 1,
      "Key": "",
      "Phrase": "",
      "Lesson": false,
      "Attempt": "",
      "Succeeded": false
    },
    {
      "Seq": 15,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 0,
      "Place": "Plain",
      "Area": "Square",
      "LocationId": 28437,
      "Actor": "Nyccolhoth Lhavyniwyn",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I spy the well, stone-rimmed and central, but a bucket\u0027s empty and there\u0027s nothing to do. Might as well chuckle at the sky before I turn to something else.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 1,
      "Group": 3,
      "Block": 1,
      "Key": "",
      "Phrase": "",
      "Lesson": false,
      "Attempt": "",
      "Succeeded": false
    },
